---
import epdmImage from '../assets/images/service-tpdm.webp'
import bitumenImage from '../assets/images/service-bitumen.webp'
import tpoImage from '../assets/images/service-tpo.webp'
---

<div class="container">
  <div class="title-container">
    <span class="reveal reveal-grow"></span><h2 class="section-title reveal reveal-right">Commercial Roofing</h2>
  </div>
  <div class="text-card roboto">
    <h3>Build It Right With The Top Experts</h3>
    <p>Roofing Technicians with decades of experience under their belts build better roofs - period.</p>
    <p>
      At <strong>Riverside Roofing Inc</strong>, we know well-paid and well-trained professionals are the first step in ensuring our clients receive a roof that meets or exceeds it's expected lifespan. 
      That's why only the best make it into our crews. 
    </p>
    <p>Our technicians are men that have worked together for years as a team - led by supervisors known and employed by our family for decades. This ensures that your <strong>roof is secure</strong> and the job <strong>completed on time</strong>.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="text-card">
    <h3>A Sound Roof Begins With The Right Materials</h3>
    <p>Choosing the right roofing system and materials for your building involves many factors such as the slope of your roof, expected level of foot-traffic, HVAC equipment and budget.</p>
    <p>Our helpful guides to the most commonly installed systems below are a great starting point in making the right choice for your roof!</p>
  </div>
  <div class="systems-collection">
    <div class="text-card">
      <h3>Low-Slope and Flat-Top Membranes</h3>
    </div>
    <div class="articles-grid">
      <div class="card reveal reveal-up">
        <img src={tpoImage.src} alt="" class="card-img">
        <div class="card-body">
          <h4>TPO Roofing</h4>
