  </div>
  <div class="cta-card">
    <p><strong>Still not sure where to begin?</strong> Let us guide you through the process by giving us a call or completing our simple contact form.</p>
    <a href="#" class="cta-btn">Contact Us</a>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
h3, p {
}

.cta-card {
  text-align: center;
  width: clamp(25%, 450px, 80%);
  background: var(--light-blue);
  border: 4px solid var(--primary-blue);
  border-radius: 15px;
  margin-top: 5rem;
  margin-inline: auto;
  padding: 1rem;
  font-weight: 500;
}

.text-card {
  width: clamp(50%, 500px, 90%);
}

.articles-grid {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
  padding: 0 2rem;
  gap: 10px;
}

.systems-collection {
  margin-top: 3rem;
}

.card h4 {
  font-size: 0.9rem;
}
.card-body {
  font-size: 0.75rem;
}

@media (max-width: 768px) {
  .articles-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
  }
}

@media (max-width: 480px) {
  .articles-grid {
    grid-template-columns: 1fr;
  }
}
</style>
